```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Bus as Bus de Mensajería
    participant Consumer as AlertMessageConsumer
    participant Service as NotificationProcessingService
    participant ProfileRepo as INotificationProfileRepository
    participant TrackingRepo as INotificationTrackingRepository
    participant ChannelService as ChannelSelectionService
    participant Factory as NotificationAdapterFactory
    participant Adapter as INotificationAdapter
    participant Provider as Proveedor externo

    Bus->>Consumer: Entregar mensaje de alerta confirmada
    activate Consumer

    Consumer->>Consumer: MapToAlert(message)
    Consumer->>Service: ProcessAsync(alert)
    activate Service

    Service->>ProfileRepo: GetByOlderAdultIdAsync(olderAdultId, profileVersion)
    activate ProfileRepo
    ProfileRepo-->>Service: NotificationProfile
    deactivate ProfileRepo

    loop Por cada destinatario habilitado del perfil
        Service->>TrackingRepo: GetByAlertAndRecipientAsync(alertId, recipientId)
        activate TrackingRepo
        TrackingRepo-->>Service: null
        deactivate TrackingRepo

        Note over Service: No existe una notificación previa.<br/>Se crea Notification en memoria.

        Service->>Service: CreateNotification(alert, recipient)

        Service->>ChannelService: SelectApplicableChannels(alert, profile, recipient)
        activate ChannelService
        ChannelService-->>Service: Canales aplicables ordenados por prioridad
        deactivate ChannelService

        Note over Service: Se selecciona la primera configuración<br/>de canal aplicable.

        Service->>Factory: Create(channelType, providerId)
        activate Factory

        Factory->>Adapter: Supports(channelType, providerId)
        activate Adapter
        Adapter-->>Factory: true
        deactivate Adapter

        Factory-->>Service: INotificationAdapter compatible
        deactivate Factory

        Service->>Adapter: SendAsync(alert, recipient, channel)
        activate Adapter

        Adapter->>Provider: Solicitar envío de la notificación
        activate Provider
        Provider-->>Adapter: Respuesta de entrega exitosa
        deactivate Provider

        Adapter-->>Service: AdapterSendResult<br/>DeliveryStatus = Delivered
        deactivate Adapter

        Service->>Service: CreateAttempt(notification, channel)

        Service->>TrackingRepo: SaveAttemptAsync(attempt)
        activate TrackingRepo
        TrackingRepo-->>Service: Intento registrado
        deactivate TrackingRepo

        Note over Service: Notification.Status = Delivered<br/>CompletedAt = fecha actual

        Service->>TrackingRepo: SaveNotificationAsync(notification)
        activate TrackingRepo
        TrackingRepo-->>Service: Estado almacenado
        deactivate TrackingRepo
    end

    Service-->>Consumer: NotificationProcessingResult<br/>Status = Delivered<br/>ShouldAcknowledgeMessage = true
    deactivate Service

    Consumer->>Bus: Confirmar mensaje (ACK)

    deactivate Consumer
    ```